# ==============================================================================
# Syncalibur Multi-Repository Fleet List (repos.list.example)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to `repos.list` (gitignored) or manage it via CLI:
#   syncalibur fleet add ~/projects/my-app --mode=commit-generator
#   syncalibur fleet scan ~/projects
#   syncalibur fleet status
#   syncalibur fleet start
# ==============================================================================
#
# Supported formats:
# 1. Standard path (uses repo-local .syncalibur or global default):
# /home/username/projects/Syncalibur
#
# 2. Bracketed attributes (tailored mode per repo):
# /home/username/projects/k8sfundamentals [mode=commit-generator] [remote=origin]
# /home/username/projects/corporate-api [mode=pr] [remote=origin]
#
# 3. Inline key-value format:
# /home/username/projects/devops-odyssey mode=commit-generator

